    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      202.97,
      397.2,
      226.31
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      239.09,
      397.19,
      262.79
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Local Authorities(Special Provisions) Act, No. of 2017.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      276.05,
      397.19,
      373.43
    ],
    "text": "2.(1) Nomination papers submitted, under section 28of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance (Chapter 262)(hereinafter referred to as \u201cthe Ordinance\u201d) in respect ofelections to the Pradeshiya Sabhas set out in the Schedulehereto in response to the Notices published under section26 of the Ordinance are hereby deemed to be of no force andeffect and as if such nomination papers had never beensubmitted.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      386.69,
      397.21,
      422.63
    ],
    "text": "(2) The Notices published under subsection (3) of section38 of the Ordinance, in respect of elections to the PradeshiyaSabhas set out in the Schedule are hereby revoked.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      435.89,
      397.2,
      557.99
    ],
    "text": "(3) Deposits made under section 29 of the Ordinance inrespect of candidates nominated by an independent groupfor election to the Pradeshiya Sabhas set out in the Schedule,shall notwithstanding anything to the contrary in section30 of the Ordinance, be refunded, on the production by theperson who made the deposit, of the receipt issued to suchperson under subsection (3) of section 29 of the Ordinance,together with interest on such deposit at the rate of twelveper centum, per annum, from the date of deposit to the dateof refund.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      571.25,
      397.2,
      631.79
    ],
    "text": "3. Notwithstanding anything to the contrary containedin section 82 of the Local Authorities Elections(Amendment) Act, No. 22 of 2012, steps shall be commencedunder the Ordinance for the holding of elections to thePradeshiya Sabhas out in the Schedule hereto:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      645.05,
      397.19,
      668.63
    ],
    "text": "Provided that the notice of nomination in terms of theOrdinance shall be published on such date as the Minister",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
